  "details": "Currently, the Personal Space feature uses a fixed distance, which causes avatars to automatically disappear once that threshold is reached.\n\nWhile the feature itself is very useful, the fixed distance can feel restrictive in practice.\n\nDepending on the situation—such as conversations, events, world scale, or personal comfort—the current distance may feel either too short or too long.\n\nAs a result, avatars sometimes disappear unintentionally, which can disrupt communication and immersion.\n\nIt would be very helpful to have an option that allows users to customize the Personal Space distance (for example, through a slider or preset options).\n\nThis would make the feature more flexible and comfortable for a wider range of users and play styles, while preserving its original purpose.",
